openchaos NOTICE
================

This project adapts API *shapes* and concepts from:

- Hegel (https://hegel.dev/) — MIT License — property-based testing protocol
  and per-language clients. openchaos does not vendor libhegel or hegel-core
  inside openchaos-core.
- CodSpeed (https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed) — Apache-2.0 — inspiration
  for named instruments and simulation-mode logical work metering. openchaos
